  "description": "Actually, I didn't want to be a teacher. I gave up my dream and was about to take responsibility for the path I chose, when a cocky boy said, \"Would you like to lend me a light?\". My life as a teacher seems to be going awry as I get entangled with this cocky kid who has genius talent, overflowing wealth, and fame. A story about school life intertwined with dreams, talent, and love.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 10 extra chapters.*",
